<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>PrompTugal: the investment</title>
<meta name="description" content="How PrompTugal would work as a company: what an investor buys, what the money is for, the structure, the team's stake and the phases. Investor deck 5, November 2026.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="deck.css">
<style>
  .x5-lede { font: 400 26px/1.45 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .x5-note { font: 400 22px/1.4 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .x5-goal { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: 26px 36px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 30px; margin-top: 44px; }
  .x5-goal .n { font: 500 20px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .14em; color: #8fd18f; }
  .x5-goal h3 { font-size: 44px; }
  .x5-goal p { font: 400 24px/1.4 var(--sans); color: #c8c4ba; margin-left: auto; max-width: 640px; }
  .x5-feeds { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
  .x5-feeds .card { padding: 26px 24px 28px; border-top-width: 8px; }
  .x5-feeds .card h3 { font-size: 30px; } .x5-feeds .card p { font-size: 22px; }
  .x5-arrows { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 20px; height: 44px; }
  .x5-arrows span { display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 0; height: 0; border: 16px solid transparent; border-bottom: 24px solid var(--ink); border-top: 0; margin-top: 10px; }
  .x5-not { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 50px; }
  .x5-not div { border: 2px dashed #6b6c72; padding: 24px 26px; }
  .x5-not .k { font: 500 20px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ff7a7f; }
  .x5-not p { font: 400 23px/1.4 var(--sans); color: #c8c4ba; margin-top: 12px; }
  .x5-decks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 44px; }
  .x5-decks .tag { color: #8fd18f; } .x5-decks p { font: 400 22px/1.35 var(--sans); color: #c8c4ba; }
</style>
</head>
<body><main class="deck">

<!-- 1 · cover -->
<section class="slide pic lightpic">
  <img class="bg" src="img/hero-explorers.jpg" alt="" style="object-position:right center">
  <div class="veil light" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(246,243,236,.97) 0%, rgba(246,243,236,.88) 38%, rgba(246,243,236,0) 62%)"></div>
  <div class="head"><span><b>Investors</b> · deck 5</span><span>v1.0 · 7 November 2026</span></div>
  <div class="inner" style="max-width:920px">
    <div class="kicker">The investment, as a company</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:90px">Equity in a company that is already running, at the explorer's stage.</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="font-size:30px">What you invest in, what the money is for, who holds a stake, and how the company changes as it grows. For the investor who has seen deck 1 and asks: how would this work?</p>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span style="background:rgba(246,243,236,.92);padding:6px 12px;color:#3f424a">The investment · image: AI-made</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 2 · in one line -->
<section class="slide v ink">
  <div class="head"><span><b>In one line</b></span><span>02</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">The investment, in three parts</div>
  <h2>You buy equity in the company. The money runs the company. The technology is already being built.</h2>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:70px">
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">01 · WHAT YOU BUY</div><h3>Equity in My Feeds</h3><p>The Portuguese company that publishes PrompTugal.news and is expected to take the PrompTugal name.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">02 · WHAT IT PAYS FOR</div><h3>The operations</h3><p>Preparing the company for the next level: commercialisation, services and editorial, with very technical journalists.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">03 · WHAT IS ALREADY THERE</div><h3>The platform and a team</h3><p>A newsroom that runs every hour, and a team already onboarded. With funds, we accelerate.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 3 · what you invest in -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>What you invest in</b></span><span>03</span></div>
  <div class="cols w40 center" style="height:100%;margin-top:0;gap:40px">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">One company, many open-source neighbours</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:64px">Your equity is in My Feeds, the company becoming PrompTugal.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks" style="margin-top:40px">
        <li><b>My Feeds</b> (MYFEEDS AI, UNIPESSOAL, LDA): incorporated in Portugal on 22 October 2025, seat in Loulé, the Algarve.</li>
        <li><b>Dinis Cruz</b> is its founder and CTO, today its sole director and shareholder.</li>
        <li><b>The neighbours</b> are his other open-source startups: their code flows in under Apache-2.0. Investing here is investing in My Feeds only.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="src">Company details as cited from the business registers by web-summit.sgit.ai/investors/company/; the strategy: open-source.sgit.ai.</div>
    </div>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 860 720" width="860" height="720">
      <defs><marker id="m3" markerWidth="12" markerHeight="12" refX="10" refY="6" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L12,6 L0,12 z" fill="#9d9580"/></marker></defs>
      <g stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="8 7" marker-end="url(#m3)">
        <line x1="135" y1="96" x2="280" y2="216"/>
        <line x1="430" y1="96" x2="430" y2="216"/>
        <line x1="725" y1="96" x2="580" y2="216"/>
        <line x1="265" y1="594" x2="320" y2="482"/>
        <line x1="595" y1="594" x2="540" y2="482"/>
      </g>
      <g font-size="22" text-anchor="middle">
        <rect x="20" y="40" width="230" height="56" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="2"/><text x="135" y="76">sgit.ai</text>
        <rect x="300" y="40" width="260" height="56" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="2"/><text x="430" y="76">The Cyber Boardroom</text>
        <rect x="610" y="40" width="230" height="56" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="2"/><text x="725" y="76">sgraph.ai</text>
        <rect x="140" y="594" width="250" height="56" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="2"/><text x="265" y="630">VoiceDebrief.ai</text>
        <rect x="470" y="594" width="250" height="56" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="2"/><text x="595" y="630">RiskMandate.ai</text>
      </g>
      <rect x="190" y="226" width="480" height="250" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="10 8"/>
      <text x="430" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#006600" letter-spacing="2">YOUR EQUITY IS HERE</text>
      <rect x="215" y="282" width="430" height="170" fill="#006600"/>
      <text x="430" y="340" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="40" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">My Feeds</text>
      <text x="430" y="380" text-anchor="middle" font-size="22" fill="#e2eedf">becoming PrompTugal</text>
      <text x="430" y="420" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#e2eedf">publisher of PrompTugal.news</text>
      <text x="430" y="700" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">Dashed lines: open-source technology shared under Apache-2.0</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 4 · the plan -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The plan</b></span><span>04</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">What the company does with the investment</div>
  <h2>Six kinds of work, one goal: a company that pays for itself.</h2>
  <div class="x5-goal"><div class="n">THE GOAL</div><h3>Be profitable</h3><p>Aim, in Dinis Cruz's words: profitable in the next couple of months. Web Summit Lisbon is the first test.</p></div>
  <div class="x5-arrows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
  <div class="x5-feeds">
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Services</h3><p>The team and the platform, deployed for a customer's project.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">02</div><h3>More events</h3><p>The same platform for the next event: data before, during, after.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">03</div><h3>More companies</h3><p>Coverage and customers beyond one summit and one country.</p></div>
    <div class="card r"><div class="n">04</div><h3>Customer support</h3><p>People who answer, for readers and for paying customers.</p></div>
    <div class="card r"><div class="n">05</div><h3>Customised versions</h3><p>A person's, a team's or a delegation's own edition.</p></div>
    <div class="card r"><div class="n">06</div><h3>Selling open source</h3><p>Dual licensing: our code under a company's own terms, maintained by us.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="src">Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026. The revenue streams in full: deck 1 and promptugal.news/investors/business-plan.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 5 · use of funds -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>What the money is for</b></span><span>05</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">The operational level</div>
  <h2>The money goes into running the company: the people who sell, serve and write.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 500" width="1680" height="500" style="margin-top:40px">
    <rect x="0" y="40" width="300" height="400" fill="#121317"/>
    <text x="150" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="38" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">The</text>
    <text x="150" y="264" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="38" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">investment</text>
    <path d="M300,40 C560,40 560,30 820,30 L820,120 C560,120 560,140 300,140 Z" fill="#006600" opacity=".2"/>
    <path d="M300,140 C560,140 560,145 820,145 L820,235 C560,235 560,240 300,240 Z" fill="#c52830" opacity=".2"/>
    <path d="M300,240 C560,240 560,260 820,260 L820,350 C560,350 560,340 300,340 Z" fill="#1f4fa8" opacity=".2"/>
    <path d="M300,340 C560,340 560,375 820,375 L820,465 C560,465 560,440 300,440 Z" fill="#121317" opacity=".16"/>
    <g>
      <rect x="820" y="30" width="860" height="90" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#d9d2c1"/><rect x="820" y="30" width="10" height="90" fill="#006600"/>
      <text x="856" y="68" class="serif" font-size="30" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">The next level</text>
      <text x="856" y="102" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">preparing the company: a CEO, the structure, ready for Series A</text>
      <rect x="820" y="145" width="860" height="90" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#d9d2c1"/><rect x="820" y="145" width="10" height="90" fill="#c52830"/>
      <text x="856" y="183" class="serif" font-size="30" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Commercialisation</text>
      <text x="856" y="217" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">selling customisation, events and licences to people who ask for them</text>
      <rect x="820" y="260" width="860" height="90" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#d9d2c1"/><rect x="820" y="260" width="10" height="90" fill="#1f4fa8"/>
      <text x="856" y="298" class="serif" font-size="30" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Services</text>
      <text x="856" y="332" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">delivering for customers: support, customised versions, maintenance</text>
      <rect x="820" y="375" width="860" height="90" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#d9d2c1"/><rect x="820" y="375" width="10" height="90" fill="#121317"/>
      <text x="856" y="413" class="serif" font-size="30" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Editorial</text>
      <text x="856" y="447" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">hiring journalists, very technical people, to work with the agents</text>
    </g>
    <text x="560" y="492" text-anchor="middle" class="mono" font-size="18" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="1">EQUAL BANDS: CATEGORIES, NOT PROPORTIONS</text>
  </svg>
  <p class="x5-lede" style="margin-top:14px;max-width:1500px">The core technology is developed by Dinis Cruz, full time, across his companies. <b style="color:#121317">What the investment adds is the company around it:</b> the people who sell, serve and write.</p>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment · Dinis Cruz, 7 Nov 2026 · no amounts are published</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 6 · why funds accelerate -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Why money accelerates here</b></span><span>06</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">The team is in place; onboarding was fast</div>
  <h2>We are not raising to start. We are raising to go faster.</h2>
  <div class="cols c4" style="margin-top:56px;gap:36px">
    <div class="stat"><div class="v">3 days</div><div class="l">from the first commit (4 Nov 2026) to a full publication</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="v">426</div><div class="l">releases, each built, checked and deployed automatically</div></div>
    <div class="stat r"><div class="v">~25</div><div class="l">named agent roles running PrompTugal, under one human operator</div></div>
    <div class="stat r"><div class="v">7</div><div class="l">people at the summit: the front-end team</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="vs" style="margin-top:60px">
    <div class="side old"><h3>Today</h3><p class="body">A mix of Gen Z and Gen X, working unpaid in a win-win: they learn a lot, fast. Nobody has been asked or promised anything yet.</p></div>
    <div class="mid">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="side new"><h3>Once there is investment</h3><p class="body">Everybody paid, everybody with a stake, the gaps filled with senior people. "Once we have funds, we can just accelerate."</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="src">Counted from the public repository, 7 November 2026; agent roles from CLAUDE.md; the team and the quote: Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 7 · the structure -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The structure</b></span><span>07</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Who does what, and what is still missing</div>
  <h2>A technical founder, and a business partner to run the company.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 560" width="1680" height="560" style="margin-top:40px">
    <rect x="160" y="10" width="560" height="150" fill="#121317"/>
    <text x="190" y="50" class="mono" font-size="18" fill="#8fd18f" letter-spacing="2">FOUNDER AND CTO</text>
    <text x="190" y="96" class="serif" font-size="38" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">Dinis Cruz</text>
    <text x="190" y="134" font-size="21" fill="#c8c4ba">the core technology, full time, across his companies</text>
    <rect x="960" y="10" width="560" height="150" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="12 8"/>
