    <text x="890" y="352" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Strategic people</text>
    <text x="890" y="392" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">some of the best we can find,</text>
    <text x="890" y="422" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">hired with equity</text>
