<!-- 8 · the CEO we want -->
<section class="slide pic lightpic">
  <img class="bg" src="img/talent-algarve.jpg" alt="" style="object-position:right center">
  <div class="veil light"></div>
  <div class="head"><span><b>The business partner</b></span><span>08</span></div>
  <div class="inner" style="max-width:1060px">
    <div class="kicker red" style="color:#c52830">Wanted: a CEO</div>
    <h2 style="font-size:68px">Someone from the news industry who wants to build the news company the industry never let them build.</h2>
    <ul class="ticks" style="margin-top:40px">
      <li><b>Runs all operations,</b> so the founder stays on the technology.</li>
      <li><b>Has run companies;</b> ideally very senior in the news industry.</li>
      <li><b>Comes from the people already involved:</b> "if somebody is not interested enough to be involved right now, are they only going to flip when they have equity? I don't like that."</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="src">Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment · image: AI-made</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 9 · who holds a stake -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Who holds a stake</b></span><span>09</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Investors, the founder, the team</div>
  <h2>Three kinds of stake. The team's comes alive as the company succeeds.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 560" width="1680" height="560" style="margin-top:36px">
    <text x="0" y="30" class="mono" font-size="18" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2">WHO HOLDS EQUITY · CIRCLES NOT TO SCALE</text>
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <circle cx="130" cy="180" r="110" fill="#1f4fa8"/><text x="130" y="190" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">Investors</text>
      <text x="130" y="338" font-size="21" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">buy equity</text><text x="130" y="368" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">in the company;</text><text x="130" y="398" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">their money runs it</text>
      <circle cx="400" cy="180" r="110" fill="#121317"/><text x="400" y="190" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">The founder</text>
      <text x="400" y="338" font-size="21" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">Dinis Cruz</text><text x="400" y="368" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">founder and CTO;</text><text x="400" y="398" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">today sole shareholder</text>
      <circle cx="670" cy="180" r="110" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="14 9"/><text x="670" y="190" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#006600">The team</text>
      <text x="670" y="338" font-size="21" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">growth shares</text><text x="670" y="368" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">core team and</text><text x="670" y="398" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">strategic hires</text>
    </g>
    <line x1="840" y1="20" x2="840" y2="440" stroke="#d9d2c1" stroke-width="2"/>
    <text x="900" y="30" class="mono" font-size="18" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2">THE TEAM'S GROWTH SHARES · HOW THEY COME ALIVE</text>
    <line x1="920" y1="300" x2="1640" y2="300" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="4"/>
    <g>
      <!-- stage 1: joins, all dormant -->
