      <text x="1620" y="346" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">A sale or</text><text x="1620" y="374" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">a set date</text><text x="1620" y="400" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">all alive</text>
