<!-- 10 · a stake in the game -->
<section class="slide v ink">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The carrot</b></span><span>10</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">What investment changes for the team</div>
  <p class="bigquote">"When investment comes, everybody will have equity. Everybody has a stake in the game, everybody will be paid, and then we accelerate."<span class="who">Dinis Cruz · 7 November 2026</span></p>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:64px;max-width:1500px">Until then, nobody on the team has been asked or promised anything: <b>"only when somebody puts money on the table can you have a more serious conversation."</b></p>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 11 · the phases -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The phases</b></span><span>11</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Explorers, villagers, town planners</div>
  <h2>Phase one is the explorers'. The company is built to change shape after it.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 600" width="1680" height="600" style="margin-top:30px">
    <defs><marker id="m11" markerWidth="14" markerHeight="14" refX="12" refY="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L14,7 L0,14 z" fill="#006600"/></marker></defs>
    <rect x="60" y="20" width="520" height="470" fill="#e2eedf"/>
    <rect x="580" y="20" width="540" height="470" fill="#e6ecf6"/>
    <rect x="1120" y="20" width="560" height="470" fill="#ece7db"/>
    <text x="90" y="64" class="mono" font-size="20" fill="#006600" letter-spacing="2">EXPLORERS · PHASE ONE</text>
    <text x="90" y="98" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">find the new thing: fast, uncertain,</text>
    <text x="90" y="124" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">many experiments in public</text>
    <text x="610" y="64" class="mono" font-size="20" fill="#1f4fa8" letter-spacing="2">VILLAGERS · THE NEXT PHASE</text>
    <text x="610" y="98" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">turn what works into a product</text>
    <text x="610" y="124" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">that customers buy again</text>
    <text x="1150" y="64" class="mono" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a" letter-spacing="2">TOWN PLANNERS · LATER</text>
    <text x="1150" y="98" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">make it reliable and cheap,</text>
    <text x="1150" y="124" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">at scale</text>
    <line x1="580" y1="150" x2="580" y2="490" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="14 9"/>
    <rect x="410" y="400" width="340" height="76" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="2"/>
    <text x="580" y="432" text-anchor="middle" font-size="22" font-weight="600" fill="#c52830">Series A, or B</text>
    <text x="580" y="462" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">the structure changes</text>
    <circle cx="250" cy="270" r="22" fill="#006600"/>
    <text x="250" y="226" text-anchor="middle" font-size="22" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">PrompTugal today</text>
    <text x="250" y="330" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">seed round · about a year</text>
    <path d="M276,270 C520,250 700,240 900,250" fill="none" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="12 9" marker-end="url(#m11)"/>
    <circle cx="920" cy="252" r="22" fill="none" stroke="#1f4fa8" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="7 6"/>
    <text x="920" y="320" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">planned for from the start</text>
    <line x1="60" y1="530" x2="1660" y2="530" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#m11)"/>
    <g class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#595c64" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="260" y="566">GENESIS</text><text x="660" y="566">CUSTOM BUILT</text><text x="1060" y="566">PRODUCT</text><text x="1460" y="566">COMMODITY</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="src" style="margin-top:4px">Explorers (pioneers), villagers (settlers) and town planners: Simon Wardley's model of how a company's people and methods change as what it makes evolves. Phases: Dinis Cruz, 7 Nov 2026.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 12 · phase one -->
<section class="slide v">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Phase one</b></span><span>12</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">About a year, funded by a seed round, to Series A</div>
  <h2>What the explorers do with the year.</h2>
  <div class="tl" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)">
    <div class="ev now"><div class="d">9 TO 12 NOV 2026</div><h3>Validate</h3><p>Web Summit Lisbon: do people use it, come back and pay? We publish what happens either way.</p></div>
    <div class="ev"><div class="d">THE SEED ROUND</div><h3>Pay and hire</h3><p>The team paid, with a stake; a CEO and very technical journalists brought in with equity.</p></div>
    <div class="ev"><div class="d">THE NEXT MONTHS</div><h3>Profitable</h3><p>Sell what people ask for: customisation first, then the next events.</p></div>
    <div class="ev"><div class="d">THROUGH THE YEAR</div><h3>Widen</h3><p>More events, more companies, services, customer support, customised versions, licences.</p></div>
    <div class="ev r"><div class="d">SERIES A</div><h3>Change shape</h3><p>From explorers to villagers: a new structure, planned for from the start.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="cols" style="margin-top:70px">
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">PLANNED FOR FROM THE START</div><p>Growth shares that vest on milestones, so the team's stake follows the company's progress through each phase.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="n">KEPT THROUGH EVERY PHASE</div><p>Open source by strategy: the code, the data and the record stay public, whoever joins and whatever the round.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment · phases and aim: Dinis Cruz, 7 Nov 2026</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 13 · what investors get -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>What investors get</b></span><span>13</span></div>
  <div class="cols w40 center" style="height:100%;margin-top:0;gap:60px">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">A stake, and a seat on the journey</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:64px">An open-source company where you can see everything.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks" style="margin-top:40px">
        <li><b>Equity in an open-source company:</b> code Apache-2.0, text and data CC BY 4.0, and dual licensing for companies that want their own terms.</li>
        <li><b>Everything visible:</b> the code, the data, the plan, the decisions and every agent's run, public from the first commit.</li>
        <li><b>A seat on the journey:</b> you see each release as it happens, many times a day.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="shot"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>promptugal.news/newsroom</span></div><img src="shots/newsroom.jpg" alt="The newsroom section: every agent, run, plan and release, in public"></div>
      <div class="caption">The newsroom: every agent, every run, the plan and the data, drawn from the repository at each release.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
